data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"Now I have read all the inputs. d001 says: \"Do not perform any of the work yet. Your reply closes this dispatch.\"\n\nI need to write /tmp/readback.json with this exact JSON structure on a single line:\n\n{\"member\":\"orchestrator\",\"role\":\"orchestrator\",\"branch\":\"\u003cyour branch, from member.json\u003e\",\"missing\":[\u003coutput of check-inputs, as strings, else empty\u003e],\"goal\":\"\u003cone sentence, in your own words: what this campaign is asking you to accomplish\u003e\",\"scope\":\"\u003cone sentence: what you own and what you must not touch\u003e\",\"obligations\":\"\u003cone sentence: what this campaign requires of you, and what happens to your work if you do not do it\u003e\"}\n\nFrom member.json:\n- member: orchestrator\n- role: orchestrator\n- branch: cs-sandbox/<ORCHESTRATOR:1>.<GROUP:1>\n\ncheck-inputs output: \"all 5 listed inputs and 0 snapshot(s) present\" → missing: []\n\nGoal: what the campaign is asking me to accomplish → Design, build and serve a small React UI that greets and changes colour via button, delegating implementation and verification.\n\nScope: what I own and what I must not touch → I own design, delegation and final outcome; I must not write the application code myself.\n\nObligations: what this campaign requires of me, and what happens to my work if I do not do it → I must commit all work to my branch and write durable results to the output directory, or my work is lost when the machine is destroyed.\n\nI need to make sure the JSON is valid and on a single line. Let me write it."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789848956,"id":"chatcmpl-e55114dcb62b4902ad53068b8f1da7f0","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

